      "updated": 1779750492163,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Probar que g(x) | x^n + 1 => g(x) | x⁷ + 1",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Probar que g(x) | x^n + 1 => g(x) | x⁷ + 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x3-lB1ca2YTKowKHmC_fQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1451.9114231076053,
      "y": 2239.58554394832,
      "width": 1072.933349609375,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2yf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 337884260,
      "version": 297,
      "versionNonce": 994586596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779750596929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Recordemos que g(x) = 1 + x + x³, luego sabemos que\n\n1 + x + x³ = 0 (mod g(x)), luego 1 + x = x³ (mod g(x))\n\n{Recordando que estamos en Z2}\nx⁷ = x³ * x³ * x\n   = (1+x)(1+x)x\n   = (1+x+x+x²)x\n   = (1+x²)x\n   = x+x³\n   = x+1+x\n   = 1\n\nLuego x⁷ + 1 => 1 + 1 => 0\n   ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recordemos que g(x) = 1 + x + x³, luego sabemos que\n\n1 + x + x³ = 0 (mod g(x)), luego 1 + x = x³ (mod g(x))\n\n{Recordando que estamos en Z2}\nx⁷ = x³ * x³ * x\n   = (1+x)(1+x)x\n   = (1+x+x+x²)x\n   = (1+x²)x\n   = x+x³\n   = x+1+x\n   = 1\n\nLuego x⁷ + 1 => 1 + 1 => 0\n   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RYkBvJjlVZMEFWAJp-sUw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1450.3568539122994,
      "y": 2912.2188299499485,
      "width": 496.8666687011719,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2yg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 443943524,
      "version": 28,
      "versionNonce": 910092124,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779750609373,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Por lo tanto g(x) | x⁷+ 1",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Por lo tanto g(x) | x⁷+ 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
