    },
    {
      "id": "xxErAnyKuJsLYWfbXZ9Ue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2008.5314113391112,
      "y": 3034.740312607409,
      "width": 158.39999389648438,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2yl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 753191388,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 2083619684,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779750674183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x^n + 1\n--------\n  g(x)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x^n + 1\n--------\n  g(x)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JSvDDHyLyxAofDltpBSAm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1450.230268358772,
      "y": 3235.474845716059,
      "width": 1051.2667236328125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2ym",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1931037532,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 1030170980,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779750720264,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "=> Queremos hallar un polinomio H(x) tal que:\ng(x) h(x) = x⁷ + 1\n\nSabemos que gr(g) = 3 y gr(x⁷+ 1) = 7 => gr(h(x)) = 4",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "=> Queremos hallar un polinomio H(x) tal que:\ng(x) h(x) = x⁷ + 1\n\nSabemos que gr(g) = 3 y gr(x⁷+ 1) = 7 => gr(h(x)) = 4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sRFb2-WLonk8H9zoSEEA2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1457.2137463416416,
      "y": 3446.367340783572,
      "width": 1189.5,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c2yn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1060467684,
      "version": 730,
      "versionNonce": 192256038,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779916026030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entonces contiene al x⁴ y por teoría tiene la constante en 1\n\n=> h(x) = x⁴ + ax³ + bx² + cx + 1, con a,b,c en {0,1}\n\nComo x⁴ mod g(x) = x³ * x mod g(x) = (1+x)x = x+x²\n\n=> h(x) = x⁴ + x² + x + 1.\n\nVerificando: (x³ + x + 1) (x⁴ + x² + x + 1) = \nx³ con h(x) => x⁷ + x⁵ + x⁴ + x³\nx con h(x) => x⁵ + x³ + x² + x\n1 con h(x) => x⁴ + x² + x + 1\n\nCantidad:\nx⁷ : 1 vez => x⁷\nx⁵ : 2 veces => 0\nx⁴ : 2 veces => 0\nx³ : 2 veces => 0\nx² : 2 veces => 0\nx  : 2 veces => 0\n1  : 1 vez => 1 ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entonces contiene al x⁴ y por teoría tiene la constante en 1\n\n=> h(x) = x⁴ + ax³ + bx² + cx + 1, con a,b,c en {0,1}\n\nComo x⁴ mod g(x) = x³ * x mod g(x) = (1+x)x = x+x²\n\n=> h(x) = x⁴ + x² + x + 1.\n\nVerificando: (x³ + x + 1) (x⁴ + x² + x + 1) = \nx³ con h(x) => x⁷ + x⁵ + x⁴ + x³\nx con h(x) => x⁵ + x³ + x² + x\n1 con h(x) => x⁴ + x² + x + 1\n\nCantidad:\nx⁷ : 1 vez => x⁷\nx⁵ : 2 veces => 0\nx⁴ : 2 veces => 0\nx³ : 2 veces => 0\nx² : 2 veces => 0\nx  : 2 veces => 0\n1  : 1 vez => 1 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NlUel7tdQMjziGi9Od_s9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1451.750437710837,
